  93:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_rcc_ex.c ****   *         clocks (SDMMC, CKPER, FMC, QSPI*, OSPI*, DSI, SPI45, SPDIF, DFSDM1, DFSDM2*, FDCAN, SWP
